  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Finance for Community Resilience: Monitoring, Evaluation, Research and Learning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to deliver monitoring, evaluation, research and learning (MERL) for the Climate Finance for Community Resilience Programme. To track and report on the programme results; improve delivery; share impact of the programme with key stakeholders and with the public; and identify the impact and achievement towards enhancing community-level resilience to climate change and disasters in the Pacific and further afield.</narrative>
  </description>
